  "_comment": "Infrastructure lifecycle registry (ADR-0077). Maps each /infrastructure component to its endoflife.date product slug, version evidence, and a release-notes URL template ({version} = recommended target). eolProduct=null is an honest GAP (no public lifecycle feed). versionSource: 'gitops' = generator reads an image tag, 'gitops-chart' = generator reads an Argo Helm chart revision (neither proves deployment); 'probe' = BFF reads a live build-info response; 'unknown' = not detectable. NEVER hand-type a version here.",
